{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NXCt2SIw5n1795214712.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>SpaceX旗下的AI人工智能程式開發平台Cursor，據報正考慮停止使用中國AI模型。</p><p></p><p>《CNBC》報道，Cursor的程式開發模型Composer 2，建構於中國企業月之暗面的Kimi K2.5模型之上，是眾多使用中國模型的美國企業之一。但根據眾議院一份報告披露，Cursor計劃逐步淘汰中國開權重模型，以避免地緣政治風險。SpaceX於今年6月收購Cursor，並於8月完成交易。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T00:09:33.886637+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T22:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T20:31:36.095568+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T00:02:59.011490+00:00","content_hash":"78e58a3462dd8ca14dc2b897019e970b4c33f1f2c877751df8b063606d1b226e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T00:09:33.886637+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}